1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
Hey…

2
00:00:02,348 --> 00:00:03,920
so gaye kya?

3
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:06,552
Pata hai tum
gussa ho.

4
00:00:06,572 --> 00:00:08,260
Hona bhi chahiye.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,020
Maine jo
bhi bola na…

6
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:13,300
woh mera matlab
nahi tha.

7
00:00:13,644 --> 00:00:15,940
Bas darr gayi
thi ki tum

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,380
kahin pehle
chale na jao.

9
00:00:20,108 --> 00:00:21,816
Aur yeh
tumhare saath

10
00:00:21,836 --> 00:00:23,380
fair nahi tha.

11
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,336
Text nahi kiya,

12
00:00:25,356 --> 00:00:27,620
kyunki "sorry" type
karna bahut chhota

13
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,200
lag raha tha.

14
00:00:30,284 --> 00:00:31,480
I'm sorry.

15
00:00:33,676 --> 00:00:35,420
Kal baat karein kya?

16
00:00:36,492 --> 00:00:38,040
Sab theek karne
ke liye nahi…

17
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,240
bas baat
karne ke liye.

18
00:00:41,484 --> 00:00:42,616
Please…

19
00:00:42,636 --> 00:00:44,344
gusse mein mat sona,

20
00:00:44,364 --> 00:00:45,580
okay?

